{
    "type": "relic",
    "name": "Rocket Launcher",
    "icon": {
        "description": "Shoot a rocket that explodes in a <hl>$aoe_radius$m radius</hl>, dealing <dmg>$min_dmg$-$max_dmg$ $$dmg$</dmg>\n\nReloads using <white>a Charges</white>, which recharge very slowly over time.",
